🔹 Real-world Example 💡
A company wants a single monitoring dashboard.
Data comes from:
📊 Prometheus → Infrastructure metrics
 📜 Elasticsearch → Application logs
 🗄️ MySQL → Business data
Grafana combines all of them into one dashboard.
👉 Engineers can monitor the entire platform from a single screen.

🔹 Benefits of Multiple Data Sources ⚡
✔ Centralized visibility 👀
 ✔ Faster troubleshooting 🚨
 ✔ Better decision-making 📊
 ✔ Unified monitoring experience 🔗

🔹 Key Concepts to Remember 🧠
✔ Data Source = Source of monitoring data 📦
 ✔ Grafana does not store metrics ❌
 ✔ Prometheus is the most common source 📊
 ✔ Multiple sources can be connected 🔗
 ✔ One dashboard can display different datasets 🚀

💡 Pro Tip:
 A powerful Grafana setup often combines metrics, logs, and business data into a single dashboard for complete observability.
